magicLink.body:
Use this link to sign in to ManuHaven:

{url}

The link expires in 5 minutes and works once. If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email.

resetPassword.body:
Use this link to choose a new ManuHaven password:

{url}

The link expires in 1 hour. If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email and your password stays the same.

verifyEmail.body:
Use this link to verify your email address and finish creating your ManuHaven account:

{url}

If you didn't create an account, you can ignore this email.
